window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She’s a doctor in a broken marriage. He’s a wounded werewolf with a secret heart. Can they heal each other before it's too late?</p> <p>Lena has spent years trying to salvage her crumbling relationship, but when she stumbles upon a gravely injured werewolf in the woods, her life takes a turn she never saw coming. As she saves Liam’s life, she’s drawn to his strength, vulnerability, and the unspoken connection that sparks between them. He makes her feel seen in ways her husband never has, and her heart starts to yearn for a love she thought she'd lost.</p> <p>Liam has always fought hard to protect his territory, but when a deadly encounter with a vampire leaves him near death, salvation comes in the form of Lena, a human doctor. She’s everything he didn’t know he needed—strong, compassionate, and in a marriage that’s crumbling around her. For the first time, Liam sees a future that might be worth fighting for.</p> <p>In a world where werewolves and vampires clash, Lena and Liam must confront the challenges of their pasts and the rising dangers around them. Can Lena save more than just his life, or will the secrets they both carry tear them apart before they can find happiness together?</p> <p>If you love the sweet, slow-burn romances, the tension of fated mates, and a world rich with supernaturals, you'll fall for Lena Saves Her Love.</p> <p>Listen now to discover their story today!</p>"; 
